# The archive's model-bound work in the media pool, a kind a line: the backlogs the models worker
# rotates between, in this order, and the second worker the other way round. `ops=` names the EMS
# ops a kind's steps call: a worker for another EMS instance takes the kind only when that instance
# serves them all and stamps them as the primary does. Every kind a pipeline step names with
# `requires: models` is here, or it never runs (test/media/model-slots.test.ts).
faces ops=faces.detect,faces.detect_video,image.renditions,video.poster
diarize ops=speech.voiceprint,speech.active_speakers
